{"items":[{"id":"805999810","root":"805999810","user":{"id":"698051","name":"一般路过异常JK","avatar":"ffaeef8c686e4e8e76581ae0"},"text":"中考分流，把就算上了大学也会被ai替代的分去打螺丝","time":1776565142554,"floor":23,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"805999755","root":"805999755","user":{"id":"6004470","name":"你也很牛吗？","avatar":"1ff7a7d190fc93a90d680f6a"},"text":"再看看我们出版行业，没水平或没时间的老师为了评职称写书写论文都在用ai，或者正常书稿也因为学校对查重率的苛刻要求，只能用ai降重，把好好的稿子变得一塌糊涂。然后现在有的期刊和出版社又开始限制ai率，那怎么在用ai写好书稿后降低ai率呢？答案是用更先进、更具有针对性的ai软件去降。ai催生ai，ai对抗ai，人类一败涂地。","time":1776564431802,"floor":22,"likes":7,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[]},{"id":"805999748","root":"805999748","user":{"id":"284799","name":"基老闭嘴","avatar":"e22822b18153a4242fb04366"},"text":"大学几乎要变成基础教育与社会其实并不能提供那么多大学生的就业岗位之间的矛盾","time":1776564333531,"floor":21,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":5,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"805999768","root":"805999748","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"ai本来就减少岗位需求，ai也减少了学生辛苦高考报名大学的需求。大学被夹在这中间一根筋两头堵。[emot=acfun,1656/]我目前感觉就是这样。只有那种有国家支撑的专业（含就业输送的）还能活一活，比如免费师范这种。","time":1776564592386,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"805999796","root":"805999748","user":{"id":"284799","name":"基老闭嘴","avatar":"e22822b18153a4242fb04366"},"text":"水姐～\n这个要怎么搞 回复兑换 小助手就开始复读了[emot=acfun,1665/]\n\r\n[img=图片]https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/284799_9f43fc801983452692e499c05a365601.jpeg[/img]","time":1776564992253,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":["65593a31b360ff95635b9529"],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"805999804","root":"805999748","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"哈哈哈哈我看看咋回事","time":1776565058939,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"基老闭嘴","replyToUserId":"284799","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"805999702","root":"805999702","user":{"id":"604497","name":"🌧萝萝岛麻吕☔","avatar":"eb750e6e6f23f7bf631e0535"},"text":"听完感觉像竹子一样，在看不见的地方根茎都已经能掀翻水泥了，","time":1776563952019,"floor":20,"likes":7,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":true,"replyPreview":[{"id":"805999706","root":"805999702","user":{"id":"604497","name":"🌧萝萝岛麻吕☔","avatar":"eb750e6e6f23f7bf631e0535"},"text":"表面还是人畜无害的翠竹和竹笋","time":1776563982666,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"805999713","root":"805999702","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"贴切的比喻","time":1776564040995,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"805999635","root":"805999635","user":{"id":"12316569","name":"明原黑","avatar":"6856426925f5f495d6bf7467"},"text":"昨天参加分享也是，现在做开源软件也不在乎扩展性和生态了，有特殊需求直接在基础上让ai改就行了。\n\n码农别说退休，可能再两年就完了[emot=acfun,2783/]","time":1776563191237,"floor":18,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":3,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"805999739","root":"805999635","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"ai改得真是好，我这两天研究腾讯🦐＋obsidian，一个纯代码小白输几行需求就可以得到网页了，不知道那些花几年学前端的作何感想。\n哦，不对，想起来我是学翻译的啊，那没事了。[emot=acfun,1656/]","time":1776564245326,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"805999795","root":"805999635","user":{"id":"7503062","name":"Ghost-Girls","avatar":"573c73d24dc5b802ae744313"},"text":"逻辑复杂了，用AI很大可能性会浪费时间，开源+AI不太行，简单功能的，我是觉得AI直接重构更好，反编译然后再重构。\nAI写的开源控件，一堆Bug，上过当了，唉。","time":1776564966264,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"806000675","root":"805999635","user":{"id":"1648177","name":"却因今夜栏干月","avatar":"3d40af1eebc15fa80d860b97"},"text":"啥时候来个ai同声传译 翻译这个行业就基本完蛋了","time":1776574117292,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"805999628","root":"805999628","user":{"id":"10203030","name":"累了比克","avatar":"0810e4770e06794a8ccbef0d"},"text":"感觉独立思考的能力很重要，也感谢母校能培养出能明辨是非的能力，以及纵容一些年轻人的任性[emot=acfun,1684/]","time":1776563141022,"floor":17,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"805999705","root":"805999628","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"我感觉大学还是应该走这个方向：帮学生建立自己的系统。就像我自己在大学做的：专业课随便学学，大力发展副业[emot=acfun,1656/]","time":1776563978096,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"805999596","root":"805999596","user":{"id":"55513717","name":"森崎唱歌好好听","avatar":"00af64e9f114128aa20987c3"},"text":"教育系统吗？我感觉ai也没几年啊，对各行业的冲击肯定是无与伦比的，但是教育这个行业往往是最有滞后性的，如果现在就说濒临崩溃，是不是证明我们的教育本来就不太行？[emot=acfun,1671/]","time":1776562921073,"floor":16,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":8,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"805999613","root":"805999596","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"各行各业都濒临崩溃，只是表层还绷着一口气罢了。\n跟行业本身行不行没关系，底层逻辑改变了导致的。","time":1776563008333,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"